0009DD  1  2D 2D 2D 2D  
0009E1  1  2D 2D 2D 2D  
0009FC  1               ttl2:
0009FC  1  7C 20 20 20          .BYTE   "|       W Y R M H O L D          |",0
000A00  1  20 20 20 20  
000A04  1  57 20 59 20  
000A1F  1               ttl3:
