000A46  1  2D 2D 2D 2D  
000A4A  1  2D 2D 2D 2D  
000A65  1               ttl_by:
000A65  1  41 6E 73 77          .BYTE   "Answer the summons of Wyrmhold Castle",0
000A69  1  65 72 20 74  
000A6D  1  68 65 20 73  
000A8B  1               ttl_prompt:
000A8B  1  50 72 65 73          .BYTE   "Press any key to begin thy quest",0
000A8F  1  73 20 61 6E  
000A93  1  79 20 6B 65  
000AAC  1               ttl_keys1:
