000AFD  1               intro_msg:
000AFD  1  57 65 6C 63          .BYTE   "Welcome to Wyrmhold. Seek the castle and speak with its ruler.",0
000B01  1  6F 6D 65 20  
000B05  1  74 6F 20 57  
