000B40  1  20 74 6F 20  
000B44  1  44 4F 53 3F  
000B4F  1               
000B4F  1               win1:
000B4F  1  2A 2A 2A 20          .BYTE   "*** VICTORY! ***",0
000B53  1  56 49 43 54  
000B57  1  4F 52 59 21  
000B60  1               win2:
000B60  1  54 68 65 20          .BYTE   "The dragon is slain. The land is saved!",0
000B64  1  64 72 61 67  
