001596  3               ; these with the MG_* base by position so regions don't read as a
001596  3               ; grid. Each variant is a DIFFERENT asymmetric arrangement.
001596  3               
001596  3               ; grass variant: blades clustered differently
001596  3  E0 00 04 04          .BYTE   MGV_GRASS+0, %00000000,%00000100,%00000100,%00000000,%00100000,%00100010,%00000000,%00000000
00159A  3  00 20 22 00  
